{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1000_015siz", "source_sha256": "fc9f9bfe62fe53f49c20bb446de331ea963086ec603c2ff5b818940814e4d671", "ja": "うん、サイズはバッチリ。\nあとは、姿勢をもっとよくして……。", "zh": "嗯，尺寸正合适。\n剩下的就是，要把仪态调整得更好一些……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9dc39c0d8658edbe865ffc19f6acb496b6ba0a1b6a20133f763dc2b80d336575", "ja": "お疲れ様、静香。\n新しい衣装はどうだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，静香。\n新服装感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "a495dafcfeea193c5b73e6f2e4f6eb28d6b614c3577cee53f46857c31cd908df", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\nちょうど、ポージングの研究をしていたところです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n我正好在研究摆姿势。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "6b71bc75865d0cf15e77fe1a0745556da03e8ae27132523360663a39e70dee98", "ja": "クールな曲に合わせた衣装ですからね。\n衣装も私も、カッコよく見えるようにって。", "zh": "毕竟是配合酷帅歌曲的服装嘛。\n为了让服装和我看起来都更帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0e253a68a78956e5fd0c530350bae208af89f08bd3686def588800be98d6d34f", "ja": "おお。なんか気合いが入ってるな！\nまあ、今のままでも十分カッコいいと思うけど。", "zh": "哦。感觉你干劲十足啊！\n不过，我觉得你现在这样已经够帅了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "daa12a71b94c0fadf0a725b4822f5360b97da68bb62414bcd6b02d217c13e045", "ja": "えっ、そうですか？\n……ありがとう、ございます。", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？\n……谢、谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1006_p", "source_sha256": "12df458993207d3ec6b39f62f11f5c2a2e5e7fb03708a63aaad44f5142e619bf", "ja": "んっ？　どうした？\n何か気に入らないところでもあったか？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？\n有什么不合心意的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "3ced3ba4eee542fde14cbae5b9403dcc6bb658a401ace91db9bbeefb2f3803f3", "ja": "い、いえ。とっても素敵な衣装だと思います。\n衣装には不満はありません……。ただ……。", "zh": "没、没有。我觉得这套服装非常漂亮。\n我对服装没有任何不满……只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "007c23ca67d3ed448f1f29880ecd3834fb19407c21361192430e435ef9ae280a", "ja": "{$P$}は、\nどの衣装を着ても、いつも褒めてくれますよね？", "zh": "{$P$}不管我穿哪套服装，\n平时都会夸我的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "b44cc5ea257d9dfaf9505ebae2dcc013ddf38e2bcb4d5335c59d26b0e450d8ef", "ja": "もちろん、褒めてくれるのは嬉しいですけど……。\nでも、それって……お世辞ですよね？", "zh": "当然，被您夸奖我是很高兴啦……\n可是，那些夸奖……其实是客套话吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cb65f89bc0c8144a11bc80aa486d25ca85a804dec68f5fc25a3ea401e07ecfb2", "ja": "なっ！？　はあ……静香はそんな風に思ってたのか。\nまったく。俺はいつだって、本心しか言わないよ。", "zh": "什！？唉……静香原来是这么想的吗。\n真是的，我一直说的都是真心话啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1011_p", "source_sha256": "60b51c8ea660220769419ee9b513e7954e5b4e7298f10dadce2aaf6df4feca20", "ja": "さっきだって、そうだ。\n静香が本当にカッコよかったから……。", "zh": "刚才也是一样。\n因为静香真的很帅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "55aad9d49c0af58335a7ea4ee4ce0737f181f8f9e49d70c8a30bb78417b9dcc4", "ja": "わ、わかりました！　{$P$}が\n本気で言ってるって、わかりましたから！", "zh": "我、我知道了！　我知道{$P$}\n是认真的了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "9dcd23f8b423ed7a39c918cab1ab578c6d98652dbc6aad20bf8b052c2b049132", "ja": "はあ～。ちょっと自信がなかっただけです……。\nもらった曲や衣装に相応しい私になれてるのかなって。", "zh": "唉～我只是有点没自信……在想自己是不是已经成为配得上您给的歌曲和服装的我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1014_p", "source_sha256": "416a149b98006c404255bacfcfbe339d5839f880bc405c34bc2c13701edc334d", "ja": "そうか……。そういえば、静香のブログ、好評だな！\n早くステージが見たいって、コメントもあったっけ。", "zh": "这样啊……对了，静香的博客反响很好啊！还有人留言说想早点看到你登台呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "996eee6a89775781d2f186a41b5ced793535dc1274d84e776b4a4e5accf95d31", "ja": "本当ですか？　コメントまだ見れてなくて……。\nファンの人達も、褒めてくれてるんですね。ふふっ。", "zh": "真的吗？我还没来得及看评论……。\n粉丝们也都在夸我呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1016_p", "source_sha256": "54d2c7055fb4ade7feb86ddbd1ce56a8baac99951e52e1ea23988da311bbadb3", "ja": "ああ。俺もファンの人達も、本心からの言葉だよ。\nステージで輝く静香がみたい。", "zh": "是啊。我和粉丝们说的都是真心话。\n我想看到在舞台上闪耀的静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "85e3c7ad4f2b99ce11ce921addf43710c3c52e3c351462e5947de2b92b494433", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　私、もっと頑張ります！\n私の活躍を楽しみにしてる人のために……！", "zh": "谢谢您！我会更加努力的！\n为了那些期待着我大放异彩的人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "f95ba7bcaa543012d4c334ee8f2d21e0fea63a680cc02f2f2398d02fbe7abc45", "ja": "それで……今、時間ありますか？\nその……ポージングの練習に付き合ってほしくて。", "zh": "所以……你现在有时间吗？\n那个……我想请你陪我练习摆姿势。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8e6e29f6504cc6c14cc9841fd72013b885dc8a480220bf9e7347061397b1d136", "ja": "わかった。時間は大丈夫だから、\n静香が納得するまで、練習に付き合うよ。", "zh": "知道了。我有时间，所以会陪静香练习到她满意为止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0314_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "02f9042fc4226466329e83825f40c35c03d567d0e8262358fe82aea66e55730a", "ja": "よかった……。気づいたことがあれば教えて……\nって、何ニヤニヤしてるんですか！　もう……。", "zh": "太好了……。要是注意到什么还请告诉我……\n话说，您在那笑嘻嘻地看什么呢！真是的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
